Extracted fdt@hk07 (default config) from stock EWS377-FIT firmware
(model 'Qualcomm IPQ807x/AP-HK07') and substituted real hardware values:
RGB status LED on GPIO54/55/56, reset button GPIO52, MDIO PHY reset
GPIO43/44, 2.5G uplink PHY at addr 28. Documents WiFi board data
(WLAN.HK.2.5.r4-00745; bdwlan.b210 default / b290 ECW230v3) and the
remaining unit/UART-blocked items in PORT-STATUS.
---
 PORT-STATUS-ews377ap-v3.md                    | 33 ++++++---
 .../dts/ipq8072-engenius-ews377ap-v3.dts      | 67 ++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

